# CODEOWNERS
#
# Two sections:
#   1. Repository infrastructure — upstream's rules, unchanged. These keep CI
#      config, dependabot and the yarn config behind a maintainer review.
#   2. Frontend ownership — every file under packages/twenty-front mapped to a
#      product-domain team. See docs/frontend-ownership.md.
#
# The sections target disjoint paths, so they do not interact. Within section 2
# order is load-bearing: the LAST matching rule wins.

# ===========================================================================
# 1. Repository infrastructure (upstream)
